# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What goes to GitHub (and Overleaf): the paper, figures/fig*, code/, data/.
# Caches, pipeline runs, notebooks and archives live outside the repo, in
# ../local_only/. See README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# figures/: track only the numbered paper figures (fig1.png, fig3_distance_spectra.pdf, ...)
figures/*
!figures/fig[0-9]*
!figures/references.bib

# LaTeX build output (regenerated by latexmk; Overleaf does not track these)
main.aux
main.bbl
main.blg
main.fdb_latexmk
main.fls
main.log
main.out
main.pdf

# Python / OS / Jupyter clutter
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb
*.npz
*.fits
*.pkl
*.log
